<title>THAILAND: Thailand's Samart Corp Q3 net falls.</title>
<headline>Thailand's Samart Corp Q3 net falls.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Audited financial results for the first nine months ending Septemer 30, 1996.</p>
<p>		   (in millions of baht unless stated)</p>
<p>			     Third quarter</p>
<p>				   1996			1995</p>
<p>    Shr (baht)		 1.52     vs	     2.30</p>
<p>    Net			105.90     vs	   160.30</p>
<p>				Nine months</p>
<p>    Shr (baht)		 5.80     vs	     6.49</p>
<p>    Net			203.41     vs	   427.93</p>
<p>NOTE: Company is a telecommunications firm.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom 662-652-0642</p>
